&gt;FFmpeg&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class="link" href="https://www.ptt.cc/man/AVEncode/DA31/M.1320786495.A.B02.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
&gt;同片源1080p與720p同流量下的畫質 - 精華區 AVEncode&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class="link" href="https://forum.videohelp.com/threads/395300-For-same-bitrate-which-looks-better-between-720p-and-1080p" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
&gt;For same bitrate which looks better between 720p and 1080p - VideoHelp Forum&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>